                <pb facs="0584" n="500" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg500"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-05-21"><hi rendition="#italic">May 21,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>We will waive formalties of the treaty as to production of papers, but should
                    have early notice of those desired.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
